<title>FINLAND: Finnish consumer confidence unchanged in December.</title>
<headline>Finnish consumer confidence unchanged in December.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish consumer confidence was unchanged month-on-month at 13.8 points in December, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
</text>
